1512:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****         /* RTOS ports that support interrupt nesting have the concept of a
1513:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * maximum  system call (or maximum API call) interrupt priority.
1514:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * Interrupts that are  above the maximum system call priority are keep
1515:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * permanently enabled, even when the RTOS kernel is in a critical section,
1516:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * but cannot make any calls to FreeRTOS API functions.  If configASSERT()
1517:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * is defined in FreeRTOSConfig.h then
1518:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * portASSERT_IF_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY_INVALID() will result in an assertion
1519:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * failure if a FreeRTOS API function is called from an interrupt that has
1520:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * been assigned a priority above the configured maximum system call
1521:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * priority.  Only FreeRTOS functions that end in FromISR can be called
1522:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * from interrupts  that have been assigned a priority at or (logically)
1523:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * below the maximum system call interrupt priority.  FreeRTOS maintains a
1524:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * separate interrupt safe API to ensure interrupt entry is as fast and as
1525:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****          * simple as possible.  More information (albeit Cortex-M specific) is
