2350:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * above the maximum system call priority are kept permanently enabled, even
2351:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * when the RTOS kernel is in a critical section, but cannot make any calls to
2352:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * FreeRTOS API functions.  If configASSERT() is defined in FreeRTOSConfig.h
