2355:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * assigned a priority above the configured maximum system call priority.
2356:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * Only FreeRTOS functions that end in FromISR can be called from interrupts
2357:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * that have been assigned a priority at or (logically) below the maximum
2358:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * system call  interrupt priority.  FreeRTOS maintains a separate interrupt
2359:/home/zz/quard-start/Quard-Star/trusted_domain/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****      * safe API to ensure interrupt entry is as fast and as simple as possible.
